    {
      "id": "claim_aeb6e7bee7cf496da0362e2394113c8d",
      "statement": "The bjw-s-labs app-template Helm chart is vendored once as a shared OCIRepository (currently pinned to ref.tag 5.2.1, with a Helm-chart layerSelector) inside the `common` Kustomize component that every app namespace includes; application HelmReleases consume it via chartRef kind OCIRepository name app-template, so chart upgrades are a single tag bump.",
