        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b51d2f5fdf8545abba8aca1da2c3b92c",
      "statement": "A single cluster-wide ImageUpdateAutomation runs every 5 minutes with the Setters strategy scoped to ./kubernetes/apps/default, commits as flux-bot to main of the flux-system-https GitRepository, and its policySelector (matchLabels image-automation: enabled) restricts updates to ImagePolicies created by the image-automation component; apps consume the resolved tag via the `{\"$imagepolicy\": \"NAMESPACE:APP:tag\"}` setter marker in HelmRelease values.",
      "evidence": [
