    {
      "id": "claim_db7d5b1fe04b4596a6c5994070bd0f3b",
      "statement": "dependsOn is declared per Kustomization (not per app directory), enabling cross-namespace ordering such as gitea waiting on topolvm, external-secrets, and cloudnative-pg-cluster while its sibling gitea-runner repeats only storage and external-secrets; HelmReleases additionally self-heal with install/upgrade remediation (retries, rollback, cleanupOnFail).",
