    {
      "id": "claim_697d3270dde84270b81f51c6944df814",
      "statement": "Upstream CRDs are delivered from the upstream repos via pinned GitRepositories in kubernetes/flux/meta/repos: external-dns-crds points at https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/external-dns (Renovate-managed tag v0.23.0, interval 15m, ignore restricted to /config/crd/standard/) and gateway-api at https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/gateway-api (tag v1.6.2, interval 15m, ignore restricted to /config/crd/experimental/); both are wired into the repos kustomization and back the external-dns-crds and gateway-api-crds Kustomizations in kubernetes/flux/cluster/ks.yaml, which cluster-apps depends on.",
